# @kulala-vscode-restclient-compat
### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Interactive Docs (HTML)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs

### OpenAPI YAML Spec
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.yaml

### Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "{{username}}",
	"password": "{{password}}",
	"email": "{{email}}"
}

### Login User
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"email": "{{email}}",
	"password": "{{password}}"
}

### Show Public Monitor (Unauthenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/monitors/1/status

### List Monitors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitors
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Create Monitor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitors
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"url": "{{monitorUrl}}",
	"check_interval": 60,
	"webhook_url": "{{webhookUrl}}",
	"is_public": true
}

### Get One Monitor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitors/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Update Monitor
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitors/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"url": "{{monitorUrl}}",
	"check_interval": 30,
	"webhook_url": "{{webhookUrl}}",
	"is_public": false
}

### Get Monitor Checks History (Last 50)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitors/1/checks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Get Monitor Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitors/1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Delete Monitor
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitors/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
